          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo allabariga qurbaannada nabaadiinada ah waa inuu Rabbiga qurbaan dab loogu sameeyo uga bixiyaa xaydhiisa iyo badhidiisa oo dhan, taasoo uu ka gooyo meesha ay lafta dhabarka ka haysato, iyo xaydha gudaha ku duuban, iyo xaydha neefka uurkiisa ku jirta oo dhan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
